{
  "name": "dsh-simple-mode",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "author": "MeganeOnly",
  "description": "简洁模式：设置页开关“隐藏思考与工具调用过程”（think 推理、read/edit/pwsh 等卡片整体隐藏，不留空白），改为输入框上方一条极简状态行（正在思考/正在阅读…），运行结束即消失。作者：MeganeOnly。",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
